<title>NETHERLANDS: CONTENT 1996 NET IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</title>
<headline>CONTENT 1996 NET IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.27 vs   2.67</p>
<p>    Net profit			    17.8  vs  14.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     380.8  vs 316.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    26.8  vs  20.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Temporary employment group Content Beheer NV said in</p>
<p>February it expected a 1996 net of 17.8 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.50 vs   1.35</p>
<p>    Interest income			1.7  vs   1.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			28.5  vs  22.3</p>
<p>BREAKDOWN OF TURNOVER PER SECTOR</p>
<p>    Temp agencies			288.4  vs 230.3</p>
<p>    Training division		   37.1  vs  36.5</p>
<p>    Other activities		    55.3  vs  49.8</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
